# README media: IRONVOW. The title, a walk through the Gaol, a fight over
# the knight's shoulder, a glyph being drawn, the Warren, the Starvault and
# the Pit Regent. Play is the demo player's real presses; each place is
# reached with a cheat. The GIF is the demo player on floor 2.
shotscale 2
seed 37
game ironvow
wait 60
shot ironvow_title
cheat newgame 37
cheat stats 9 9 9
cheat give ARMING_SWORD
cheat equip 3
cheat floor 1
cheat noflames
cheat pos 2 1 2
cheat flame 3 3
wait 2
shot ironvow_gaol
# the GIF: floor 2, the demo player exploring and fighting
cheat floor 2
botplay 400
gifstart ironvow 4 1
botplay 1200
gifstop
# a fight: a boneguard and a tusker in front, an ooze behind
cheat floor 2
cheat noflames
cheat pos 16 2 1
cheat fight 5 3 0
wait 30
cheat fpx 58
cheat fcd 0 0
wait 22
shot ironvow_fight
# drawing a glyph (THUNDER) in the middle of a fight
press B
press RIGHT
press DOWN
press LEFT
press DOWN
press RIGHT
wait 2
shot ironvow_glyph
wait 150
# the Warren: a fungus glowing over a flame
cheat floor 3
cheat noflames
cheat pos 19 22 0
cheat flame 19 20
wait 2
shot ironvow_warren
# the Starvault's lava and its bridge
cheat floor 5
cheat noflames
cheat pos 22 4 2
wait 2
shot ironvow_star
# the Pit Regent and his three stones
cheat floor 6
cheat noflames
cheat stats 15 15 15
cheat pos 15 13 2
cheat boss 3
wait 30
cheat fpx 130
wait 3
shot ironvow_regent
